(text "J10 -> J14, straight pin-to-pin. GPIO24/25/26 read LOW when pressed.\nGPIO27..31 -> R101..R105 (1 kohm each) -> cable -> LED anodes.\nFirmware must debounce buttons and turn LEDs off at reset.\nValidate brightness and long-cable behavior on the assembled prototype." (at 25.4 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "f9d7c5d5-c675-4478-99dd-33ff96df419b"))
